sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as 用户
    participant Sender as orderSender
    participant Perp as Perpetual
    participant Dealer as MetaNodeDealer
    participant Trading as Trading库
    participant Liq as Liquidation库

    Note over User,Dealer: 事前 User deposit 到 primaryCredit

    User->>User: EIP-712 签 Order
    Note over Sender,Perp: 链下撮合后 orderSender 发 tx

    Sender->>Perp: trade(tradeData)
    Perp->>Dealer: approveTrade
    Dealer->>Dealer: 解码并验签每个 Order
    Dealer->>Trading: _matchOrders
    Trading-->>Dealer: paper/credit 变化量
    Dealer-->>Perp: traderList

    loop 每个 trader
        Perp->>Perp: _settle
    end
    Perp->>Dealer: isAllSafe

    Note over User,Liq: 清算 不走订单簿

    participant Liqtor as 清算人
    Liqtor->>Perp: liquidate
    Perp->>Dealer: requestLiquidation
    Perp->>Perp: _settle x2
    Perp->>Dealer: isSafe 与 handleBadDebt

    Note over Dealer,Perp: Funding 周期 keeper

    participant Keeper as fundingRateKeeper
    Keeper->>Dealer: updateFundingRate
    Dealer->>Perp: updateFundingRate
